{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56099","headline":"真人赞六首 四 · 杜光庭","name":"真人赞六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八观因缘门，四福从中生。\n时见有心者，思悟感天灵。\n吾今爲是故开说真妙经。\n如从经中言，忆劫皆受荣。\n习道行劝戒，以经度我形。\n思念宿命根，洗拔先身婴。\n超越过三罗，八难於是冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}